ers-raptor.png", "id": "1445954297670766", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499620532_1445954301004099_4334922826542964934_n.png?_nc_cat=111&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=MUfpnzp41b8Q7kNvwGirYJw&_nc_oc=AdpXl5tfAc2xeMQb2eZauTRKvaSRI79ib10YpNYySIUQMIBgUe9xYPJhjgi808Vq_DI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQQVFEihX4FTt7fa0xc6VyImQwnPsUlDHwF1KjPeSJmr5A&oe=6B0DBB3C"}, {"file_name": "05-sanctuary-pearl-hole-pov.png", "id": "1024895080652578", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499623585_1024895083985911_7527913330202176631_n.png?_nc_cat=110&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=B4UFeXRp4E4Q7kNvwE0CIZR&_nc_oc=Adqgo7LKlGipFbw0fCjC6oyRD6lWki-lfM1Ce1bqz9MGab7ZWJmUtSFHJU78cQZgEYQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQQx8JSpfChyKv0axRG7xFvvYY3R-oKve6Rz2FEzUDWYFQ&oe=6B0DB3EE"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "trailer-cover-2560x1440.png", "id": "1671715101338051", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499623111_1671715104671384_5875727415432959553_n.png?_nc_cat=101&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=WTsWda-X3U0Q7kNvwFuZqcv&_nc_oc=AdpuNfLreAc7etnk9Csu1aWjbSdugviyvM-o-NjLUUXV0VOwRfrcWWnqFIEN_4-jT4Q&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQRJYqvAGm8gbKDNkaDpbPCAGB6bbTWt3lsKA-GYkAsQyg&oe=6B0DC733"}, "display_name": "Crazy Golf VR", "keywords": ["Golf", "Dinosaurs", "MiniGolf", "Multiplayer", "Coop"], "long_description": "Crazy Golf VR turns mini golf into an adventure. Every course is a race to the hole: take as many strokes as you like, dodge the dinosaurs and chase your fastest time.\n\n**Six wild courses**\n- Putt through woodland meadows, alpine slopes, red-rock canyons, a glowing crystal cavern, rivers of lava and a sunken sanctuary on the ocean floor.\n- Raptors prowl the fairways and pterodactyls circle overhead. Fend them off with a plunger gun, and ring bronze gongs to lower the drawbridges.\n- New to golf? A guided Introduction teaches you to swing, move and shoot.\n\n**Play together**\n- Co-op: two to four players share one ball and race the clock together.\n- 2v2 team race: one ball per team, and the first team to the hole wins.\n- Two clubhouses, a moonlit city rooftop and a sunrise lakeside valley, host up to six players with voice chat and driving ranges for long-drive contests.\n- Invite friends and join their games in a click.\n\n**Compete and collect**\n- World leaderboards for every course's fastest time and each range's longest drive.\n- 13 achievements, each unlocking a title for your name tag.\n- Pick your cap colour, and finish the campaign to unlock a cat companion.\n\n**Play your way**\n- Teleport or smooth movement, snap or smooth turning, a comfort vignette and a seated mode.", "short_description": "Mini golf meets a dinosaur adventure. Race to the hole across six wild courses, solo or with up to three friends, and keep the raptors at bay with your trusty plunger gun."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.avivarma.ca/Crazy-Golf-VR/privacy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://www.avivarma.ca/Crazy-Golf-VR/terms.html", "publisher_name": "Harshvardhan Varma", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.avivarma.ca/Crazy-Golf-VR/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2691890164460465"}, {"id": "2776542286000603"}, {"id": "1700921480735423"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["HAND_TRACKING", "OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE", "SITTING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER", "SINGLE_USER", "CO_OP"], "id": "28857110523954655"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499624990_2180131322928189_3959385310701763709_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=108&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=YYOmJjv5DkoQ7kNvwEJ-NGk&_nc_oc=AdoGweyMbtjguSnyiuXcXpcyjxFY-mnUtGVKaLz01dRSNH8n3fMNU59iohM-VIplst0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQQEE8GEBlS6v03AILpgxofJgdJH2bHI7N33BTrJHeOCXg&oe=6B0DCB94"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_trial_offer_valid": false, "display_name": "Crazy Golf VR", "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF", "context_category": {"context_category": "GAMES", "id": "2743326035925534"}, "context_topics": [{"topic_name": "Adventure", "id": "2691890164460465"}, {"topic_name": "Sports", "id": "2776542286000603"}, {"topic_name": "Party Game", "id": "1700921480735423"}], "release_date": 1707942780, "lastRevision": {"nodes": [{"id": "7242557199169966", "release_type": "SCHEDULED", "administration_status": "APPROVED", "pdp_metadata": {"application": {"default_locale": "en_US", "id": "7242557155836637", "is_first_party": false, "enables_in_app_ads": false, "is_concept": false, "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF"}, "iarc_cert": {"id": "7100018800105874"}, "iarc_email": null, "msrp": null, "translations": {"nodes": [{"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "CoverArtPortrait.png", "id": "3495314790733443", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031587_3495314794066776_8316139556651851441_n.png?_nc_cat=107&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=LPeruU9lo90Q7kNvwFgK0Pk&_nc_oc=Ado6NI3iGl7opEbC3dU4PK3teruQTKCL5AK6W16xAsUfet7ykzF5xm3aJOZMA9WryDg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQTcP-i009plqHrv19FZnuLoNMHxyzexrCKJe9TBauiFvA&oe=6B0DAE12"}, {"file_name": "MiniLandscapeBackground.png", "id": "2116306672078035", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75593950_2116306675411368_8088691397984178912_n.png?_nc_cat=107&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=koTx7fEUSgIQ7kNvwHy6eW7&_nc_oc=AdrYHLyPFigIpR3nu4X3TpfgsLM9xzNmsKQn792vToJMY-3ZgHzWiDSxayUQRcFyhbM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQQ0GfjCBzRYfpfsb4I4QTtjwPmtPuNuy8qZk0DYhNVhBw&oe=6B0DB747"}, {"file_name": "CoverArtSquare.png", "id": "1923719118059999", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031456_1923719121393332_4504351395349498027_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=e90KD7ncK4YQ7kNvwFDqlXI&_nc_oc=AdrgRUPceDfet7LOiLLu5dX3IOAQNK_9TySBOqacv4fPN9skj4a1vZL73vkC2YhZQ-c&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQQxJRZ-gxJdlMfNpKtY8Ibg5ogSOjeloWQ8jztTUgcAnA&oe=6B0DB3E9"}, {"file_name": "Logo.png", "id": "1182902649359521", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/86619816_1182902652692854_9031720951112319284_n.png?_nc_cat=101&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=HRe52hkNp5AQ7kNvwH_YomM&_nc_oc=AdpABax4lMGQrWnheZ1bBhEgDLK2vk7iqMlJcPdvZOnG2TTcSlOGhqU_RHnRPJAZFgA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQS9eAiCt3_A9h6RQJtmSleew1dTJCPwygm8-QHZLuxKdg&oe=6B0DC5F4"}, {"file_name": "Icon.png", "id": "1037441694223645", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39003252_1037441697556978_3475259315052248174_n.png?_nc_cat=101&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=vLSRI1X8SUsQ7kNvwHJaFl8&_nc_oc=Adqi1Y8xeK2vgRZzEYjqFQ0YzsaX4cL7rpzCPAGJpVCqFf0N61PKay1-680swNnh-Bw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQTWii4cI0em9VBPpYwWYQz3BZzQvv-Le3Hrq9fTa8mGvg&oe=6B0DCF62"}, {"file_name": "CoverArtLandscape.png", "id": "927625695611298", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75361346_927625698944631_4861334867035495563_n.png?_nc_cat=108&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Y_eZl4nakOQQ7kNvwEEqJBI&_nc_oc=Ado5erPLczP_96iOAI_Oeh8AOUehVYMNHL-YpZcM-qZIukFNHEzuTESrFxMprpRV6Xs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQTU-N3qenPKFFwaFb3tB1ZJ-PWN-urkoMNbrqU92Jv-XQ&oe=6B0DA017"}, {"file_name": "HeroCover.png", "id": "225984143843777", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982460_225984147177110_482557685155359975_n.png?_nc_cat=100&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=S34fDnOBOWAQ7kNvwFlu59j&_nc_oc=AdotTFJgAqNUVsxMFsS0Ei2XDR6Lm2k1fLuwYNPTwls9HLUr2HfPmzeYAjXiTKglmGk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQQFMvKPXSDR6iaNNrgnDMF_hywFVvXD5dCaBjWLBcyU3A&oe=6B0DAB6C"}]}, "id": "801624848432451", "locale": "en_US", "screenshots": [{"file_name": "Screenshot3.png", "id": "7176409862448731", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75286676_7176409865782064_3152612281375049195_n.png?_nc_cat=106&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=26E5iO9RsAIQ7kNvwEfP2f-&_nc_oc=AdqkbRgireeipqAgj7E6w_RMXzYB2bCSzU5yfI9KWV_xl4vycd7ZTEvjwOf-mWphGBk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQQjWpCtySvDpD_FX9UnsWAmyPaksVA4VfbECWbxx1fX9w&oe=6B0DD0FD"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot2.png", "id": "404281905443729", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57572950_404281908777062_8427973265631679341_n.png?_nc_cat=108&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=yALeq83ZbhsQ7kNvwFVdNI3&_nc_oc=AdpW9JPLw9DLEb30bHj4swO4eH7XI1GQMyGFQh5i7e1KsbY2c2YCHYBOjkZFEKU85OE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQREVoI0xCXpPFmzunda3eIByTCedmsrdevy1aA_09KQqg&oe=6B0D9E64"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot1.png", "id": "351439054482587", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035400_351439064482586_7709402978214007870_n.png?_nc_cat=108&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=8qIuViqUPnQQ7kNvwEQXOOF&_nc_oc=AdrTisHR3s1mVHo9VkaVJUjhGBCzaAlc5bV-NkoqPtNeD2XRs-4801x87XsciNsJXv8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQSsKy0wZQnTvHkaF9yaBHluC-4DtC6RoVEPzE5sqfap8Q&oe=6B0DADAC"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot6.png", "id": "776949421005778", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/65402154_776949424339111_676970916754398417_n.png?_nc_cat=101&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=5jo3S-Yc99MQ7kNvwHScHRF&_nc_oc=Ado4dHCnzD3xVd79uefATX_BVgdfcOCVt2Hrumvwmglim67sxHv9Z60grMdUf_3CU8M&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQRjSeYL2-sN0YDlFrncPy9FAPw63VzDWSBKtNbyAxpvlw&oe=6B0DAAEC"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot4.png", "id": "1051867219381970", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974819_1051867222715303_1336008833305204054_n.png?_nc_cat=100&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=e5RR7aSHUCgQ7kNvwGId347&_nc_oc=AdobVMV1iikft9uob_BkLs1OyruvrAZnrLYHEyEH_2SWtAxsznqVEqUQWFlfcdfkm-o&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQRBTD6QhRibQqBo_g57JndsVJWNaXZF7sbYqA4WG7HNgw&oe=6B0DD2CE"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "CoverArtLandscape.png", "id": "1180299342948470", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982491_1180299349615136_4212956715900943579_n.png?_nc_cat=104&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=_exseBsIcQEQ7kNvwGRx5vz&_nc_oc=Adqczt_n06bMwQKUmbwmTqAtRwgH9-MIuw5yrBU294lg-4hLMCa3ZUkEIvW59QLzQ40&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQQXXVQU3P-kVGcO0V7RCEmOqO3-0gwz8ft06dUQN6YYfQ&oe=6B0DCDAC"}, "display_name": "Crazy Golf VR", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Welcome to the most jaw-dropping, tail-swinging golf experience ever! In Crazy Golf VR, you won\u2019t just be chasing birdies; you\u2019ll be dodging pterodactyls, putting through lava pits, and aiming for the elusive T-Rex hole-in-one. Get ready to swap your golf cart for a time-traveling golf pod and embark on a prehistoric adventure!", "short_description": "A fun golf game with crazy environments! \n\nMade for fun by Harshvardhan Varma."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://avivarmavr.artstation.com/pages/privacypolicy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Harshvardhan Varma", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.artstation.com/artwork/PXr3Qo", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2776542286000603"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "7242557179169968"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 3, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "4433475373542610"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1008031367839988"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "308438845097830"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "4433475373542610"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1792170000, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "4433475373542610"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "29379774435021592", "version": "1.25"}, "id": "1438346520109192", "channel_name": "LIVE"}]}, "is_for_oculus_keys_only": false, "primary_binaries": {"nodes": [{"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "7242557155836637", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "29379774435021592"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "1438346520109192"}]}, "change_log": "Version 1.25\n\nLunar Links\n- The ball now stays on the lift. It no longer floats into the air while the lift descends, whether it is rolling, resting or has just been hit.\n\nSunscar Canyon\n- The cliff village now stands at the foot of the canyon wall beside the path, instead of high above it, so you no longer see underneath its floor or into the bottom of its well.\n- The village is rebuilt for a closer look: finer stonework, rooms you can see into, a kiva with water, ladders, jars and a hearth.\n- Rock-cut steps lead from the path up to a forecourt you can walk onto.", "created_date": 1795562659, "id": "29379774435021592", "version": "1.25", "version_code": 125, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": {"id": "29379770475021988"}, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "7242557155836637", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "29379774435021592"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "1438346520109192"}]}, "change_log": "Version 1.24\n\nCinderpeak Caldera\n- The path is wider where it was tight: the third drawbridge and its approaches are now as broad as the other crossings.\n- The steepest climbs are gentler, easing the ramps either side of the third drawbridge and along the balconies.\n- Raptors now roam the caldera's path and give chase, instead of standing still.\n\nRaptors\n- Raptors stay clear of portals and launch pads, so they never catch you as you arrive or leave.\n\nComfort\n- Leaning or walking your head into a wall or rock no longer blacks out the view. The view dims instead, so you can always see the way out, and if your head stays inside, you are gently moved back to where it was clear.\n\nMain menu\n- The What's new board describes this update.\n- The tutorial stage is easy to find again: in Solo campaign, press the Introduction card to replay it any time.\n- The opening title and scenery come in more smoothly, and pressing any button plays the rest of it faster.\n- The menu sits a little higher, under the title.", "created_date": 1795530353, "id": "29375265348805834", "version": "1.24", "version_code": 124, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": {"id": "29375259078806461"}, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "7242557155836637", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "29379774435021592"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": []}, "change_log": null, "created_date": 1795467810, "id": "29367156826283353", "version": "1.23", "version_code": 123, "release_status": "PENDING", "status": "DRAFT", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": {"id": "29367153349617034"}, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "7242557155836637", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "29379774435021592"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "1438346520109192"}]}, "change_log": "Version 1.21\n\nNEW COURSE: LUNAR LINKS\n- An eighth course on the Moon: race from the launch pad across rilles and drawbridges, ride a working cliff lift 96 m down, and finish on a green under the Earth.\n- Its own music, the Lunar Voyager achievement and a new name-tag background.\n- Lift levers and gongs show a marker telling you what to pull or strike.\n\nCOURSES AND VISUALS\n- Sunscar Canyon: no more pitch-black rock recesses, and fewer gaps between the rocks.\n- Golf Volcano: a richer molten lava network.\n- Rebuilt Temple cherry trees, new hole bowls with a stone collar, and art passes across the campaign.\n- Some courses have new names.\n\nRACE, CLUBHOUSE AND MENUS\n- Clearer race display: distances, the time left to beat and how the race stands.\n- A tidier results board.\n- The clubhouse and Sunrise Valley are dressed up, the wardrobe is rebuilt, and you can sit on chairs.\n- Refreshed main menu panels: join lobby, audio, online and companions.\n- The cat companion now unlocks after a solo clear of the fourth course, including for players who already cleared it.\n\nMOVEMENT AND COMFORT\n- Jump has a natural arc, a short grace period after stepping off an edge, and landing feedback.\n- Falls: you are held safely while the next area loads.\n- Teleports only fade to black when Teleport Blackout is on, and landings no longer put your head inside nearby objects.\n\nPERFORMANCE AND AUDIO\n- Sharper image on Quest 3 and 3S: higher render resolution at a steady 90 Hz.\n- Smoother first loads: graphics are prepared on the loading screen.\n- Lighter materials across every course.\n- New creature sounds, cleaner interface sounds and better music quality.\n- Updated to Meta XR SDK 209.", "created_date": 1795287559, "id": "29342790165386686", "version": "1.21", "version_code": 121, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": {"id": "29342786288720407"}, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "7242557155836637", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "29379774435021592"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "1438346520109192"}]}, "change_log": "NEW COURSE\n- Lunar Links: an eighth course, set on the moon, with its own soundtrack of eight songs, a leaderboard, and the Lunar Voyager achievement.\n\nCLUBHOUSE AND MENUS\n- Sunrise Valley: the view from the clubhouse has been rebuilt with a stone bastion, groves, boulders and golden sunrise light.\n- The clubhouse platform has new trees and dressing.\n- Main Menu: \"Play together\" replaces the separate clubhouse and campaign pages, with larger mode and join buttons. Every menu button now highlights when you point at it.\n- Long Drive range: a cleaner board that shows only the buttons you can use, and clearer landing markers during a round.\n\nCOMPANION\n- The cat companion now unlocks when you clear the fourth course solo. If you already have, it is unlocked for you.\n\nVISUALS\n- Golf Volcano: the lava is brighter and reads as molten, with a hot orange-to-yellow glow.\n- Sunscar Canyon: recesses and overhangs that showed as solid black are now lit, and many pinhole gaps along the canyon walls are closed.\n\nSMOOTHER PLAY\n- Fewer one-off stutters the first time new areas appear, including the clubhouse and Lunar Links.\n- Faster, cleaner arrival at the clubhouse and courses, with less pop-in.\n- Lighter materials throughout the clubhouse and courses.\n\nSOUND\n- New creature contact sounds, and tidied interface sounds.\n\nOTHER\n- In-game notices now appear one at a time instead of stacking.", "created_date": 1795119390, "id": "29318629941136042", "version": "1.19", "version_code": 119, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": {"id": "29318627064469663"}, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}]}}, "viewer": {"user": null}}}